    author: "Gaurang Patoria",
    title: "Shruti Kitchenware",
    initials: "GP",
    color: "#10b981"
  },
  {
    quote: "Before Leadman CRM, we tracked inquiries manually and often lost them. Since using it, we can follow up on every lead, update statuses easily, and generate useful reports. Tracking work has become effortless.",
    author: "Rahul Surve",
    title: "Ganesh Machine Tools",
    initials: "RS",
    color: "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
    quote: "After trying google sheets and many crm products, we finally landed on using Leadman. our team got comfirtable so smoothly and we could clearlly observe the perofrmance improvement of our sales team.",
    author: "Alpesh Thesia",
    title: "Vimox Innovation Ltd",
    initials: "AT",
    color: "#ef4444"
  },
  {
    quote: "The flexibility of CRM software is what impressed us the most. They worked closely with us to customize the solution, tailoring it perfectly to our workflow. Integration was smooth and productivity is up.",
    author: "Rupesh Amreliya",
    title: "Hydropower-Tech",
    initials: "RA",
    color: "#8b5cf6"
  },
  {
